<title>UK: SBC SETS WARRANTS ON ZURICH INSURANCE.</title>
<headline>SBC SETS WARRANTS ON ZURICH INSURANCE.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>SBC sets 10 million American-style call warrants on registered shares of Zurich Insurance, lead manager Swiss Bank Corp said.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 50 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    675 CHF		   PREMIUM	20.2 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     1.79 CHF		  GEARING	7.11 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   19.MAR.99		 PAYDATE	19.AUG.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS		     MIN EXER LOT 50</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  636 CHF</p>
<p> NOTES	     </p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
